## 📊 Evaluation Metrics

| Metric | Baseline | Fine-tuned | Description |
|:---|:---:|:---:|:---|
| **Success Rate** | ✅ | ✅ | Episode success (%) |
| **Actual Time Mean** | ✅ | ✅ | Time to complete (sec) |
| **Actual Time Std** | ✅ | ✅ | Variance of completion time |
| **Predicted Time** | ❌ | ✅ | First-step time prediction |
| **Predicted Var** | ❌ | ✅ | First-step uncertainty (log_var) |
| **Time MAE** | ❌ | ✅ | |predicted - actual| 평균 |
| **Time Correlation** | ❌ | ✅ | 예측-실제 상관계수 |

